accumulate "/home/jfs/mmt/content/MathHub/MMT/LATIN2/export/lf-elpi/content/latin..NONE/$Soft$Typed$Functions".

/* generated from eta : {F,G}({x}ded (equal (apply F x) (apply G x)))⟶ded (equal F G) */

ded X2 (equal F G) :- help/eta F G X1 X2 , (pi x \ ded (X1 x) (equal (apply F x) (apply G x))).

help/eta F G (x \ prodcert (X1/1 x) (X1/2 x)) (prodcert X2/1 X2/2) :- help/eta F G X1/1 X2/1 , help/eta F G X1/2 X2/2.

help/eta F G (x \ idcert X1) (idcert X2) :- X2 > 0 , X1 is X2 - 1.

help/eta F G (x \ ptcert X1) (ptcert (eta F G X1)).

